        "end": 113.275,
        "text": "然后平台就会觉得你的正常的优质的平均内容是五万点赞量",
        "representativeTime": 111.537,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-041.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-042",
        "start": 113.275,
        "end": 115.95,
        "text": "如果你连续做了几条三千点赞量的视频的时候",
        "representativeTime": 114.613,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-042.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-043",
        "start": 115.96,
        "end": 118.538,
        "text": "平台就会说，哎你这个人做内容一点都不认真",
        "representativeTime": 117.249,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-043.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-044",
        "start": 118.538,
        "end": 122.02,
        "text": "它就会下降你的权重，并且把你的基础播放给降低，并且会比",
        "representativeTime": 120.279,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-044.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-045",
        "start": 122.03,
        "end": 124.018,
        "text": "普通人低粉丝量的人下降的更快",
        "representativeTime": 123.024,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-045.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-046",
        "start": 124.018,
        "end": 126.006,
        "text": "为什么不要妄图用ai起号呢？",
        "representativeTime": 125.012,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-046.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-047",
        "start": 126.006,
        "end": 127.852,
        "text": "因为ai只能做六十分的视频",
        "representativeTime": 126.929,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-047.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-048",
        "start": 127.852,
        "end": 131.83,
        "text": "首先起号它不是一个厚积薄发的过程，它是一个一夜成名的过程",
        "representativeTime": 129.841,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-048.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-049",
        "start": 131.84,
        "end": 133.657,
        "text": "它不是一个需要缓慢上升的曲线",
        "representativeTime": 132.749,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-049.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-050",
        "start": 133.657,
        "end": 138.59,
        "text": "这个时候你就会说了，诶我就是一直坚持坚持发，然后突然诶有一条爆了，我就做成了",
        "representativeTime": 136.124,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-050.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-051",
        "start": 138.6,
        "end": 140.522,
        "text": "你以为这是你坚持的结果吗？不是啊",
        "representativeTime": 139.561,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-051.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-052",
        "start": 140.522,
        "end": 143.645,
        "text": "是你之前做的东西都是屎，然后你突然开窍了，这才是起号",
        "representativeTime": 142.084,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-052.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008",
          "SHOT-009"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-053",
        "start": 143.645,
        "end": 147.61,
        "text": "你可以让ai在你写作的过程中去补齐你一些知识上的缺陷，也可以让ai",
        "representativeTime": 145.627,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-053.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-009"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-054",
        "start": 147.62,
        "end": 149.095,
        "text": "和你进行聊天去头脑风暴",
        "representativeTime": 148.358,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-054.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-009"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-055",
        "start": 149.095,
        "end": 151.911,
        "text": "但是绝对不要去做那种用ai一键生成你的脚本",
        "representativeTime": 150.503,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-055.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-009"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-056",
        "start": 151.911,
        "end": 156.338,
        "text": "然后你拿着脚本去拍，这种事情今天就说到这里，我是人类智商编导，下课",
        "representativeTime": 154.125,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-056.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-009",
          "SHOT-010",
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
